28
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,637
Either that or Knights of Darkness.

29
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:08,560
I'm sure you can understand why
we were so curious about you.

30
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,657
One last thing?

31
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:16,269
Do you mind telling us
what your names are?

32
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,460
Not at all. I'm Eugeo.

33
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:23,320
And this here is Kirito.

34
